d, non-grey pixels lie strictly inside it.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed1852178230/12/1.py:106:    - Repaint the entire grey border of that frame with the looked-up legend color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed1852178230/12/1.py:277:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
